  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "c1f34c7e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# 最终项目：电子阀门\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b01f7682",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 理论信息\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "72055c59",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在本项目中，您将构建一个使用直流电机控制阀柄旋转的模型。 然后，您将创建一个反馈调节器，以保持通过阀门的所需流体流量。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![7 клапан 1.png](attachment:7 клапан 1.png)\n\n</div>\n\n您只需要对系统的电气和机械部分进行建模。 可以根据参考表中记录的比率来描述液体流速。\n\n系统的电气部分是直流电机。 直流电机包含多个铜线线圈，这些线圈与永磁体相互作用以产生机械运动。 它们通常由电阻和电感串联表示，分别表示铜线的内阻和线圈的电感。 直流电动机通常由交变电压源供电。 旋转电机还会产生反向电动势，这会增加系统的负载。 下图显示了生成的电路。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![7 клапан 2.png](attachment:7 клапан 2.png)\n\n</div>\n\n该系统的机械部分由一个旋转手柄和一个针组成，针和身体之间有恒定的摩擦。 也有刚性停止限制针的旋转从0到360度。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![7 клапан 3.png](attachment:7 клапан 3.png)\n\n</div>\n\n直流电机经由一组齿轮连接到阀手柄，该齿轮提供转动手柄的扭矩。 为了控制液体的流动，有必要模拟直流电机和阀门。 系统的输入信号是施加在电机上的电压，输出信号是流体流量。 您不需要在模型中包含\"等温流体\"域，因为您可以测量阀门的位置并使用它来计算流量。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "7 клапан 1.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "7 клапан 2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "7 клапан 3.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "452f4ab8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 实用部分\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e59fc4b1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "输入电压控制直流电机的转矩。 由于您的目标是在反馈环路中使用物理模型，因此您应该能够使用外部信号更改电压。 **受控电压源**单元（由输入信号控制的理想电压源）使用物理输入信号来控制单元的电压。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3585566c",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务1\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6e658a2d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "开始构建模型的电气部分:\r\n\r\n1. 创建一个新模型。 将**求解器配置**块（求解器设置）添加到模型中。\r\n\r\n2. 在模型中添加一个**受控电压源**单元（理想的输入控制电压源）。 它位于图书馆**物理建模->基础->电力->来源**。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a9f2d3f5",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c075caee",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![7 задание 1 решение_2.png](attachment:7 задание 1 решение_2.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "7 задание 1 решение_2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": false,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5cbf11e1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\n\n直流电机模型由电压源、电阻、电感和反向电动势串联组成。\n\n<div样式=\"文本对齐:中心;\">\n\n![7 клапан 2.png](attachment:7 клапан 2.png)\n\n</div>\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "7 клапан 2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5d4c6adc",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务2\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9e2c5571",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "继续构建模型的电气部分。\n\n1. 将以下块添加到模型中:\n\n***电阻器**（电阻器）, \n***电感**（电感线圈）, \n***电气参考**（电气接地）。\n\n2. 在**电阻**块的设置窗口中，将**电阻**参数的值设置为 `50` 欧姆(Ohms)。 \n   \n3. 在**电感**块的设置窗口中，将**电感**参数的值设置为 `1.2e-4` H(Gn)。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
