    {
      "id": "9b50c2d1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\r\n\r\n电机将电能转换为旋转能。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9a9b6521",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务3\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "15518a5d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "完成模型电气部分的搭建:\n\n1. 将**旋转机电转换器**块（电气和机械旋转域之间的接口）添加到模型中。  在块设置窗口中，将比例K**参数的**常数的值设置为 `10` B*c/高兴。 \n   \n2. 将**受控电压源**、**电阻器**、**电感器**和**旋转机电转换器**单元串联连接到闭合电路。 将**电气参考**单元连接到此电路中的任何点。\n   \n3. 将**求解器配置**单元连接到模型上的任何点。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "99576550",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
