    {
      "id": "770e2f3f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\r\n\r\n发动机通过一组齿轮连接到阀门。 阀的旋转部件可以被建模为惯性机构。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2d70d4c6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务4\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f59e4b73",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "开始构建模型的机械部分。\n\n1. 将以下块添加到模型中:\n\n***齿轮箱**（完美齿轮传动）, \n***惯性**（惯性）,\n***机械旋转参考**（机械旋转系统的参考点）。\n  \n2. 在**齿轮箱**单元的设置窗口中，将**齿轮比**参数的值设置为 `5`. \n   \n3. 在**惯性**块的设置窗口中，将**惯性**参数（惯性矩）的值设置为 `0.1` kg*m^2。\n   \n4. 将**旋转机电转换器**和**惯性**单元连接到**齿轮箱**单元。 将**机械旋转基准**单元连接到**旋转机电转换器**单元的C端口。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "51c8176d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": true,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 1,
