    },
    {
      "id": "ff22798f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\r\n\r\n阀门装备限制它的自转从0度，当阀门充分地关闭到360度，当阀门充分地打开时的停止。 要模拟这些物理限制，您可以使用**旋转硬停止**块。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "44ca5a15",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e8409ef6",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "向模型添加旋转悬挂停止:\r\n\r\n1. 将**旋转硬停止**块添加到模型中。 它在库中**物理建模->基础->力学->旋转->元素**。 将本单元的R端口连接到*****单元。\r\n2. 将另一块**机械旋转参考**添加到模型中。 将其连接到**旋转硬停止**单元的端口C。\r\n3. 在**旋转硬停止**块的设置窗口中，将**下界**参数的值设置为 `0` deg(degrees)，且**上界**参数的值等于 `360` 度(degrees)。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ff3b2003",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "#### <span style=\"background-color:#c2ebff\">决定\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
