    {
      "id": "0bd6b957",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "###\r\n\r\n您的任务是控制通过阀门的流体流量。 您将得到以度为单位的阀门角位置与流量之间的关系。 因此，您将需要测量阀门的角位置。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6de29568",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ，任务6\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
